{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8e4d6006945d280ab3b","chatId":"e4bd0c74a0ac4daba25bdbb5c11267eb","sessionId":null,"userId":69271,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1082,"promptTokens":1541,"completionTokens":24,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:44"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.007574004942149649,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8e4d6006945d280ab3a","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369764522,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:44","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8e4d6006945d280ab3a","chatId":"e4bd0c74a0ac4daba25bdbb5c11267eb","sessionId":null,"userId":69271,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n小艾在她女儿阿达六岁生日时送了她一个音乐盒，里面装着她最喜欢的古典音乐。阿达非常喜欢这个音乐盒，常常在睡觉前每晚都听它。当阿达十岁时，她不小心弄坏了这个音乐盒。于是，她把坏掉的盒子藏了起来，从未向小艾提起这个事故。一天，当小艾在整理东西时，发现了坏掉的音乐盒，她安慰阿达，告诉她事故是难免的。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，小艾最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 包容\nB) 反感\nC) 愧疚\nD) 尴尬\nE) 生气\nF) 惊讶\n\n## 问题 2\n小艾为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 她知道她女儿可能对弄坏音乐盒感到愧疚，不想让她感觉不好\nB) 她接受了她需要因为过去的错误责备阿达的事实\nC) 她很高兴音乐盒坏了，这样她可以给阿达买一个新礼物\nD) 她发现这个事件很有趣，因为她记得自己小时候的恶作剧","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.007574004942149649,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8e4d6006945d280ab3b","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369764519,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:44","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"4ad2044b42054559aac24e432d2ec862"}